
% Dirty Little Secret

a: I | bVII |
a_turnaround: I | bVII |
In: $a*3 $a_turnaround
b: I | V | vi | IV |
Vr: $b*2
PCh: ii | vi | IV | V |
c: I | IV | vi | V |
c_turnaround: IV |
Ch: $c*2 $c_turnaround
d: vi | . V | IV | . I |
dd: vi | . V | IV |
e: I | ii |
bridge: $d $dd $e
link: $a*4
Ch_2: $c*2
c_turnaround_2: IV | V | vi | VII |
Ch_3: $c*2 $c_turnaround_2
a_cadence: I | bVII . . V |
outro: $a $a_cadence
S: [Bb] $In $Vr $PCh $Ch $Vr $PCh $Ch $bridge $link $Ch_2 $Ch_3
